& [IAPL-A01] policy and projection forms
  + [requirements] IAPL-001 through IAPL-008
  + [implementation] RunPolicy and registry-derived ReadyProjection implemented under Slice1 activation
& [IAPL-A02] iteration and provider loop
  + [requirements] IAPL-009 through IAPL-017
  + [implementation] exact first and READY-continuation requests closed response admission ordered projection transcript replay terminal no-tool reflection request and one-provider-call to one-deterministic-advance IterationRecord join are implemented without provider execution
& [IAPL-A03] stop reentry and report
  + [requirements] IAPL-018 through IAPL-027
  + [implementation] deterministic and scripted tool-cap stopping exact live reentry explicit resume strict normalized replay missing-versus-invalid provider evidence and complete-versus-stopped validation implemented; live provider-attributed report replay remains pending
& [IAPL-A04] faculties boundary and acceptance
  + [requirements] IAPL-028 through IAPL-038 and IAPL-A01 through IAPL-A07
  + [implementation] Slice2 identity custody bounded transition chain exact READ exclusivity reentry fault and provider-nonclaim boundaries focused and workspace proven; provider and later release acceptance remain pending
  + [Slice3] host-built requests sanitized responses unique calls predecessor compact successor joins and terminal-only reflection are focused and workspace proven while process execution remains pending

