  + [IAPL-026] exact final registry and record remain under wrapper custody outside provider messages
  + [IAPL-027] wrapper replay reconstructs provider prefix reflection final output INSPECT and exact READ without provider or procedure re-execution
  + [equivalence] quota sixty-four terminal observation is byte-identical to P0
  + [boundary] every response envelope is named synthesized fixture evidence and provider_execution_claimed remains false

& [Slice4BAcceptance]
  + [IAPL-018 through IAPL-022] exact tool cap and provider-protocol fault stop only on a live READY registry and expose one validated reentry handle
  + [absence] exhausted response scripts retain a reconstructed failed request without response evidence or provider-call credit
  + [invalidity] supplied invalid envelopes are sanitized counted once and never authorize deterministic advancement
  + [continuity] resumed report segments accept a nonzero READY opening and preserve exact predecessor and sequence continuity
  + [equivalence] resumed execution reaches the same terminal outcome digest as uninterrupted execution
  + [boundary] terminal-reflection-pending is refused rather than mislabeled as READY stopped

