  + [admission] whole-wrapper validation precedes sanitization and closed FinalOutput parsing of one supplied reflection response
  + [equivalence] pending then admission produces the exact uninterrupted ScriptedCompleteRun for identical inputs
  + [boundary] reflection changes report phase only and leaves terminal procedure registry unchanged

